Z||000000||blazin'||11-05-2001||08:00 PM||||I'm seriously planning on swappin the engine in my '84 Fiero. I'm ready for some work and to spend some cash. I plan on doing it slowly, making sure it's right. <BR>All I need is some opinions from you guys. What engine should I go for? I'm leaning toward a 350 or just getting a 2.8 rebuilt & done up to the most that I can spend.<P>What is your opinion on the best bang for ur buck?||||reg||1
